  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> moderate evocation; <strong>CL</strong> 16th<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> none; <strong>Price</strong> 35,625 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> 5 lbs.<br>\n<strong>Recharge Cost</strong> 3</p>\n<p><strong>Description</strong><br>\nThis heavy staff has been formed out of void-compressed cinnamon bark treated with peppermint oil. Their combined, heady scents help to focus the mind, allowing use of the following manifestations:</p>\n<p><em>focused blast</em> (2 charges)<br>\n<em>greater focused blast</em> (4 charges)</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nCraft Staff, focused blast, greater focused blast; <strong>Cost</strong> 17,812 gp, 5 sp</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/ethermagic-items#toc28\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
